    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a sensory detection model used to calculate the probability of detecting an object based on distance. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This model uses a decay function to represent the decrease in detection probability with increasing distance, controlled by a decay parameter beta. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
